{"id":"663462","name":"黄瓜糖拌苹果","author":"鱼菲","authorId":"2270985","desc":"","cover":"images/663462/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"水果黄瓜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"苹果","amount":"1个"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"话梅","amount":"4颗"},{"name":"蜜饯","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"雪碧","amount":"1瓶"},{"name":"冰糖","amount":"1小把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/663462/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"雪碧倒入锅中，加入话梅、蜜饯和冰糖，小火煮至冰糖融化。","img":"images/663462/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"苹果切片备用。","img":"images/663462/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"过滤出雪碧，放入苹果片浸泡2小时以上。","img":"images/663462/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"黄瓜切片。","img":"images/663462/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后与苹果片交错摆放，撒上白糖即可。","img":"images/663462/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}